-- ### Passo 5 — Um primeiro cruzamento (prévia da Gold)

```sql
SELECT segment,
       COUNT(*) AS transacoes,
       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN is_fraud THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 2) AS taxa_fraude_pct
FROM silver_transactions
GROUP BY segment
ORDER BY taxa_fraude_pct DESC;
```

